{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "014hid_401_2_4_014_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b4a5c71fe361d90efdb456a5d6cc256aa05dc1437b204209de53417b87de32ab",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:014hid_401_2_4_014_01_09_a:2_4_014_01_09_a:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4403db68aa674aa30bea26c7eabd775c8f3faa7322ebffd09f2e6e2fd427c53e",
      "text": "……噢，●●●●プロデューサー。\n辛苦了。有时间聊聊吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_401_2_4_014_01_09_a:2_4_014_01_09_a:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f67d281510c3701a8628e2f61e47f2661863cc1f5954ded407e9d98cd84c8d99",
      "text": "刚才和家里人聊起前几天的演唱会，\n不知不觉也想和●●●●プロデューサー聊聊了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_401_2_4_014_01_09_a:2_4_014_01_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23a8ae8ab6ff45a131effc1a4b4468a0d2dcc9243a0366e87c72c8db1a9b3790",
      "text": "……啊，谢谢。我在舞台上看到的景象，\n真想也让你看看啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_401_2_4_014_01_09_a:2_4_014_01_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e6668a4d6c9f9b1c0ceea7889574d62995cbb48db0d5a07aaa71cb2081e09d5",
      "text": "不管看向哪里都是最棒的笑脸。\n真的是一场很棒的演唱会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_401_2_4_014_01_09_a:2_4_014_01_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf6457c2a2d8a925972c30dfaca47c372f1eaec6a6eacc9e7dfde15acc2a030b",
      "text": "……其实啊，在等待出场的时候，我总想着作为FRAME的\n代表必须加油，心里憋着一股劲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_401_2_4_014_01_09_a:2_4_014_01_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5430d48527b480d0a41f09947656436695e3270fff100214728377a330b873a0",
      "text": "察觉到这一点的你走过来跟我搭话了吧。\n多亏了你，我才能把心态转换成去享受演唱会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_401_2_4_014_01_09_a:2_4_014_01_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9675882381533bc0799cade896711649ae59300fb65779c983d75fa01d660b6b",
      "text": "谢谢你啊！真的帮了我大忙。\n今后也能助我一臂之力吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_401_2_4_014_01_09_a:2_4_014_01_09_a:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1328858b72076382b4434a1d60241e572fa393e0e21d8022ddd6bd6bcd0ca477",
      "text": "包在我身上！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_401_2_4_014_01_09_a:2_4_014_01_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3463e201d9f80b0dacfaee68d8cf8a59912470bfba3feb2416f7c8ac1cef60d",
      "text": "哈哈，我就知道你一定会这么说的。\n就指望你了，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_401_2_4_014_01_09_a:2_4_014_01_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:735d676a0400e0b8bb7f4af66e7659897e7b111a1ef578ef1270e26ca2e47fc1",
      "text": "能跟你聊聊太好了。谢啦。\n明天的工作也拜托你啦。那就回聊！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
